            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### For organisation and family Macs

A Mac managed by an organisation or a parent now keeps to what matters there:
plans, upgrade offers, the Parental tab and personal account items are hidden.
Profile shows which organisation manages the Mac, under your name.

### PIN Code

- You can now remove your PIN while Uninstall Protection is on.
- The PIN Code card sits at half width on Home.
]]></description>
